1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,110
Tinku bhaiya! When do we play the new video game?

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,915
Right now! Homework's done, it's game time!

3
00:00:06,965 --> 00:00:08,905
What's this game called?

4
00:00:08,955 --> 00:00:11,525
G.T.A.… Grand Tinku Adventure!

5
00:00:11,575 --> 00:00:12,525
Woof! Woof!

6
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:14,975
Press start! Quick, START!

7
00:00:15,675 --> 00:00:17,985
Whoa! The TV is pulling us in!

8
00:00:18,035 --> 00:00:20,315
Hold on tight, Golu!

9
00:00:22,515 --> 00:00:25,285
Wow! We're really inside the game!

10
00:00:25,335 --> 00:00:28,955
Look up there: hearts, coins and a little map!

11
00:00:29,005 --> 00:00:31,985
The sea! Palm trees! And a pink sky!

12
00:00:32,035 --> 00:00:36,330
And look, a pizza shop! I get hungry even inside a game!

13
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,815
Here comes Mission One!

14
00:00:38,865 --> 00:00:42,220
The ice-cream cart is rolling away by itself!

15
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:45,125
Quick, hop into our go-kart!

16
00:00:46,925 --> 00:00:48,825
Faster! Faster, bhaiya!

17
00:00:48,875 --> 00:00:51,320
Grab the coins on the way! Ting! Ting!

18
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:53,715
Fifty coins! Sixty! Seventy!

19
00:00:53,815 --> 00:00:55,650
Banana peel ahead!

20
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:56,815
JUMP!

21
00:00:56,865 --> 00:00:58,580
We're flying!

22
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:02,785
Got it! The ice-cream cart stopped!

23
00:01:02,835 --> 00:01:05,120
Mission passed! A hundred coins!

24
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,650
Woof! Woof! Woof!

25
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:09,880
That bark... it's Moti!

26
00:01:09,930 --> 00:01:13,815
Oh no! Moti is stuck in the toy claw machine!

27
00:01:13,865 --> 00:01:16,680
Mission Two: rescue Moti!

28
00:01:16,730 --> 00:01:19,895
I'll work the claw. A bit left... a bit down...

29
00:01:19,945 --> 00:01:23,070
Moti, don't move! Don't move at all!

30
00:01:23,870 --> 00:01:26,655
Oh no! The claw grabbed a teddy bear!

31
00:01:26,705 --> 00:01:30,350
Ha ha! Teddy is nice, but we need Moti!

32
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:33,155
One more try! Carefully this time...

33
00:01:34,955 --> 00:01:37,265
Got him! Moti is out!

34
00:01:37,315 --> 00:01:38,365
Woof! Woof!

35
00:01:38,415 --> 00:01:40,515
Mission passed! LEVEL UP!

36
00:01:40,565 --> 00:01:43,510
Moti, now you're on our team too!

37
00:01:44,510 --> 00:01:48,150
Bhaiya... whose giant shadow is that in the sky?

38
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,520
It says... the BOSS is coming!

39
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:54,280
Look at the clock: dinner time! Save the game!

40
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:58,400
Thud! We're back in the room!

41
00:01:58,450 --> 00:02:00,615
But what about that boss?

42
00:02:00,665 --> 00:02:03,820
The boss can wait. Dinner first!

43
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:07,755
Next time: Golu vs the Final Boss!

44
00:02:07,805 --> 00:02:09,370
Bye-bye, friends!

45
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:10,240
Woof!
